  1059                              <1> copyMain:
  1060                              <1> ;This is the main copying procedure! 
  1061                              <1> ;Start by checking the two files are not the same. If so, complain!
  1062                              <1> ;If returns CF=CY, error code in al. 
  1063                              <1> ;   If al = -1, same filename error!
  1064                              <1> ;   If al = -2, Root Dir full (couldn't create file)
  1065                              <1> ;   If al = -3, attempted binary read from a device
  1066                              <1> ;If returns CF=NC, file copied successfully.
