  1082                              <1> ; If in Concat and we are on the first file, just move the file pointer 
  1083                              <1> ; to the end of the file and return.
  1084                              <1> ; If in Concat and we are not on the first file, print content of 
  1085                              <1> ; destination lost and return.
  1086                              <1> ; Else, exist bad.
  1087                              <1> ;Concat is defined as (mod3Cpy or wcSrc) and oneDest
